# CIP Manager Roadmap

## Phase 1 – Basic Demo
- Implement PreFlush, Wash, Rinse, Sterilize stages.
- Use simple flags and timers.
- Manual start/stop triggers.

## Phase 2 – Enhanced Safety
- Add interlocks (tank must be empty, utilities available).
- Integrate with AlarmHandler for over-temp or no-flow conditions.
- Ensure CIP cannot run during production cycle.

## Phase 3 – Supervisory Integration
- Connect CIP completion flag to CycleManager.
- Trigger CIP automatically after batch completion.
- Provide HMI/SCADA visualization of CIP stages.

## Phase 4 – Advanced Features
- Parameterize cleaning times and setpoints.
- Add recipe management for different cleaning protocols.
- Log CIP cycles for compliance and reporting.
